  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Service Contract for Technical Facility Unit (TFU) for the EU Support to Public Finance Management Reforms in Ethiopia (EUSPRE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this contract is to recruit a Technical Facility Unit (TFU) to assist the beneficiaries of the program including public financial management institutions at Federal (Ministry of Finance (MoF)), Regional, Wereda and City administration level; Office of the Federal Auditor General (OFAG); Public Procurement and Property Disposal Service (PPPDS); and House of People Representatives in the implementation of the &quot;11th European Development Fund (EDF)&quot; that intends to enhance the transparency and efficiency of public financial management for better service delivery and inclusive development in Ethiopia. The main activities of the unit will include but not limited to the provision of technical assistance and in-service trainings in the areas of budgeting, procurement, accounting, auditing (internal and external) and oversight to enhance better public expenditure and accountability; and further strengthen IT systems (IBEX/IFMIS); provide coaching for gender responsive budgeting practices; conducting surveys/researches; administrative assistance to the Contracting Authority including communication and visibility ad hocs and serving as Secretariat to the Project Steering Committee (PSC)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
